==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|en}} {{m|frm|discernement}}, equivalent to {{suffix|en|discern|ment}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# The ability to distinguish; judgement.
# [[discrimination|Discrimination]].
# The ability to [[distinguish]] between things.
# The ability to [[perceive]] differences that exist.
# The condition of [[understanding]].
# [[aesthetic|Aesthetic]] [[discrimination]]; [[taste]], [[appreciation]].
# [[perceptiveness|Perceptiveness]].
# The ability to make [[wise]] [[judgement]]s; [[sagacity]].
# [[discretion|Discretion]] in judging [[objectively]].

====Related terms====
* {{l|en|discern}}

